        <p>• " I have been tortured for the past five years with a had skin disease. I attended the hospital for two ears, oft and on. with it. The last time I attended for five months without success. My back, chest, legs, artna, scalp in fact all over, were covered with the eruption. I could not sleep at night nor rent in the day,ime. Mv hack was a smother from neck to hips with hunt-beds of spots and nnsty sores. They worried me and tortured me so I felt as though I could tear in;.,elf to pieces. I showed .otne of my work-mat/so, and they said they never sale anything no had, and they know how I was worried and tortured by this terrible itching skin disease.</p>
