      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-03-04_WidnesExaminer_art0026" n="art0026">
        <head>OPENING DAY, FRIDAY NEXT, MARCH 10th, 1911.</head>
        <p>OPENING DAY, FRIDAY NEXT, MARCH 10th, 1911.</p>
        <p>To see our meat is to buy it. You may buy at other Ehops but you won't get the satisfaction you can from us. WHY P Because we are the only people in Warrington who sell exclusively our class of meat. We sell the Best Imported Meat. Oh, you say you have bought it before and did not !ike it That is the mistake. You did not buy OUR QUALITY. You bought Frozm Beef and River Plate Mutton.</p>
        <p>We do NOT SELL FROZEN BEEF, and all our Mutton and Lamb is New Zealand. We guarantee our Meat to be better quality than English. Doctors, Professional Oentlemen and the leading Gentry use our meat in preference to English. English butchers knowing the rich quality of Best Imported Beef buy it, and sell it for English ; at English prices. We sell it for what it is. Our beef is always tender and in prime condition.</p>
