        <p>MAYORAL CINDERELLA AT ST. HELENS. The Mayor and hfeyoreas of St. Helene (Alderman and Miss Iterrhem) gave their second Cinderella .I.dme of the season on Tuesday night. at the Torre Hall. when shoot 300 of the young people of th, town were enter- tained. The hall and the mayoral apartments were most beautifully decorated, and ever, •rrenFement poesible made for the guests. Mr. Deneett a hand provider' the musk, and the ALC.'• were Lieut.-Colonel F.. 1. Knowles!, Maar.. C. !towed, T. A.Turton, J. Cook, and J. Deseett. Mr. Resler Reese. gave a aeries of conjerieg entertainments in the Mayot's reception- room, and a wont enjoyable evening resulted.</p>
