        <p>Pink Pills for Indigestion and Gastric Ulcer.</p>
        <p>Dr.</p>
        <p>Although Miss Kitty Bees-roll Is row an active. threasll young lady, she was at onc time no dis- eby food troubles, th it existence was a misery. Miss Beecn .It, who r sides at 26, Gloucester Road, Finsbury Park, London. relates below how this change was brought about by Dr. Williams' Pink Pill'.</p>
        <p>"My health began In fail when I was about four- teen years old,- she states : " my cheeks went pale and thin; a horrid languor hung over me, and I dreaded any eat:llion. doctor ordered rest and tonics, but I grew nauseated by medicines. "Later I turned against Mod. My chest and back were racked with cruel pains alter eating, and in time I could scarcely take a sip M milk without excruciating torture..</p>
        <p>"At tact my stiff:rings culminated in Gastric Ulcer. Repeatedly ulcers forired and broke. and night and day I writhed in pain. There was a never-ending pain in iny stomach and back, which became agonisicg after even a sip of nourishment. My did was reduced to milk mixed with soda- water. My weakness grew acute A doctor said that I was too bloodkss ever to be cured.</p>
        <p>" But a friend persuaded mother to give" me Dr. Williams' Pink Pill,. After I had taken a box or two of the Pills I could take extra nourish- ment. As I persevered with IR. Williams' Pink Pills no more ulcers formed, my breathing grew comfortable, and exertion did not distress me. " Soon I could eat quite heartily and was not troubled with zny pain or discomfort. In time new blood filled my 'ens, and such benefit was given me that, aftcr having been six years an invalid, my health rotur-uxt, and I grew rosy and plump. I cannot praise Dr. lliants Pink Pills sufficiently for the perfect health they have given me.' Sufferers from Digestive Troubles should write' for booklet, " What to Eat,- free on application. Ikcause they supply Rich, Red Mood to the famished system, Dr. Williams' Pink Pills are a boon to both sexes. Of dealers, or direct from IR. Williams' Mediciae Co, ati. Holborn Viaduct, London, 23. 9.3. for one box, or 133. 9d. for sti post free, insist on having</p>
