        <p>PADDATK I.7STIRD 2ND V. OLD SEII,DIANS Played at Padgate on Saturday last. F. Millington kicked off for the visitors. After kl. Price bed repulsed Partote the visitors got in and Clarke tested Warburton with a high drive. The visitors still kept up the pressure and Clarke scored after Warburton bed saved. The homesters now played up 2trongly and Fraser tested Weston with a dropping Shot. A free kick against Padgett. lor hands was taken by illingtoo, who scored with good shot. Titan before half-time Fraser scored for Pedgate• Half-tirne : Old Strcuorlians, 2 goals ; Padgote, I goal. Resuming, both ends were visited in turn. Successive COMM'S to United were unproductive. The honresters proceeded to exert further pressure end West( n made a , splendid save from Fraser. Fen minutes from the finish Millington gave r2llsrke possession who tricked both backs and scored with a feet cross-shot, givirg Warburton no °hence. After an exciting match the result was :—Old Secundisos. 3 goals ; Padgate, 1 goal. ELEMENTARY SOHOOLS LEAGUE. RE,ULTS TO OATS.</p>
