        <p>At the Liverpool County Se/160. ou Tue.(lay beforel Sir W. B. Forwond rind other magistrate., Jaime! I larris! (20), lohntirer, pleaded guilty to havingi st Werrington,l on the let November, 1909, stolen £4 1.. 64. the money of John Ground.. . . .</p>
