        <p>Last Sunday afternoon the trimrterl; Coned Men'. and Women's Bible Clasen.. met in the inntitute, Knots. ford road. There were over fifty member. present. The subject dealt with was •• Paine and Dion lidwipleatrip " taken Intro St. Mtittbevy •ii. A nhort e' tons were given by the Key. Willinm T. .I•ye in the c twee of which he remarked that many people mistakenly atippownd that to be a mincers Chriatian meant saying farewell to all pleaanre end enjoyment, w herpes, the tine disciple of Jen,. Christ poeseased a pence tat"t passeth all under. 'Landing." Tl,.' Broad way " u hich in considered by the mejority to be the pleaannt way, doe, after all, as our Lord said, lead to destruction. Ons only had to portme the daily riper, to be convinced of thitt. The , all important question for each one to ask, in, "Whnt fruit am I bearing ?" Tried by this Christ-given test much that Is lauded in our day " advanced thought " Is found to be error. Attempts nre being made to nave men and women by culture instend of going to the root of the matter, end innimting that God's wny—the way of the cromm—ie the only way whereby men and women can be Bayed from their nine. During Lent, Mr. Jaye will give eerie,. of talk tri men only on " Reason. for Belief in God,- Q,,eutionr will be allowel.</p>
