        <p>St. Mary's Whist Drive. A very snocessful whist drive and concert in cen— nection with St. Mary's Roman Catholic schools, was held this week. Phere were shoot liQ wople present and the resist:. of the whist drive was as follows ; Ladies Miss Shamir, Miss W. Cfollll, Mws L. Cowley (OM i,4( gentleman ; gentlemen, Mr. A.Tineroaso first. Mr. W.ttiall second. Mr. .1 Eckert,ley twd cosign of the concert h wars en excellent nos. Ihe artists. were, Miss Rigby, Miss Richardson, Mr. A. Price and Mr. J. &amp;whey, red Father Itugaino.</p>
