      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-03-04_WidnesExaminer_art0097" n="art0097">
        <head>PICTURES OF THE WEEK.</head>
        <p>PICTURES OF THE WEEK.</p>
        <p>Private 14. Barter, who has lately joined the 1M Battalion of the Grenadier Guards, is only eighteen years of age tmit stands 611. BMin. in his socks, and is still growing. He is the tallest soldier in the British Army. Our picture, which shows him standing at a horse's head, gives an excellent idea of his height.</p>
