        <p>JOHN STRANGE WINTER.</p>
        <p>SYNOPSIS OP OPENING CGAPTERS. The How Alec Bland fort having smiandered hi. fortune retires front society tinder a rimed, RINI IS event witty driven to teak shelter in lodging-lonise kept hy a (mire" In the Seven Male —one of the most diatrlets cof I.ondom One wet night. at he IS creeping .osalthily op the dirty stairs le avoid his Landlord, tot. lune he owes several weeks rent. he stumble., over • horly lying on the landing contsid• the door of Ala own room. A lighted match reveals a aril. dressed rnan apparently dead. Helm folly elcothest. bet Ili, boots hare been removed hv hls assailant to prevent Identification. Illsontford tient., after conveying *toe man into lois room, that he IS .1 111 alive. Ott remoyering elonwitonmeat he tells a rambling story of having !men attacked In lola ci tooiffettr. and cola 314 N-fair mansion wlerein la hidden ingota of gold and other wonders. Illandford thinka that the xtranKer is %offering from hallneinatlons, sod einteevonr. tco estrnet his nano. Anil from aleetore he none. Boit the into, to his head IISiS 1'4111.1 partial lon of memory. While Blandfoont IN t owning OVer the whole matter Ice hi. ......I a terrific Inns-king at 'he dot takes place. The terrific hanging at the do peeved% from Wigginn. the lanciloont, who is wutile demanding hie rent At last Blandford riset PIA WA 111,11 in, .31.1 floe interview load not eteled %%ben further hammering soggestest to the polity honte N a nit on ha kf,f,`Z.tr0t...".'0,f,":4"71:;"7,„"":;:e"r he Mimic,t to condor, Al., atOl tin, atrium, through • mower under repoir to t redid alert. they ran eneape into the open. While groping their way along iIIO `O/ISer the landlord .iite • leather one Otto Illandford's pocket. mei ore emerging Into the at oft leave his twocompanionato effect his teem,. leArns that the stranger has coon him ti,,eo thonsand pooonds In tenk•notes. atet 01.15 rnileas lor gladly le...nnes his companion. and the,- settle ehanit ern In Jenny. nt reel. Captain Angier Chinnery Ylaltn I hem them. awl Illandfonl heing Ail old eh ttttt of hla relate. the event, 4, hfch ore.. e li,, Sere,. Dials and shows hin .1.1 friend the dilapidated oval ho a ore 100 lois povertY. The, then dinner, Or leather ease. IS !Orli is liSISS to contain a diamond cockle, Chintiery rec•ngtoi.e. this ea an ornament worn hy MIRK Whiten Malecom.Trafford. doleloter of Malecom Treffonl Shan, al dinner given at 11., tam floor, While Chinnery and Illandfo.rd am conversing the stranger enters the mom, and Cletnnere recognise. him as Michael LISII.OII. tal,o had come he England from Pectin In the service of the Khan.</p>
