        <p>-71ile---ikl-1--British Shopping Week.—"rhe Shopping Week movement continues to exteod, •ed everywhere OM .on already the legend " A 11-Britirib" in the windovra of the big Weet-eod firms. It. should prove a period of unprecedented commorci•l activity, sod have a far-reaching effect on all Oranchea of the textile trade, and long aft., tbe fr 'Oral is over, maim fat-Biters and trarlors ahoold reap the froltn of their efforts, daring that one period, and this they will assuredly do, if prominence be given to British-made goitres, for the poblic will expect these, and naturally take money II here what in required can to obtained. A careful selection of stock will play on importaat part , ea for as the retailer is concerned. The publio in ever attracted by appeonnces, rind a I rrrrr stook from ohich W makes avoletiant kat small ebukt</p>
